/FlexMeet.ini
/imgui.ini
*.log
*.dmp

# CMake / Visual Studio intermediate output in other build directories.
**/CMakeFiles/
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/Testing/Temporary/
*.obj
*.pch
*.ipch
*.ilk
*.tlog/
